197
00:12:49.458 --> 00:12:50.666
I could do it.

198
00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:53.000
For real?

199
00:12:53.083 --> 00:12:54.291
Yeah.

200
00:12:54.375 --> 00:12:56.750
It's my kill. I'll skin it.

201
00:13:00.541 --> 00:13:02.000
She's the real deal. hmm?

202
00:13:04.208 --> 00:13:06.208
[crickets chirping]

203
00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:22.166
Got experience hunting. Elize?

204
00:13:23.333 --> 00:13:24.625
No.

205
00:13:24.708 --> 00:13:27.125
[sniffs] I'm learning
to shoot with Marcos.

206
00:13:27.208 --> 00:13:28.916
Yeah. He told me.

207
00:13:30.958 --> 00:13:33.083
Marcos. he mentioned you're a lawyer.

208
00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:36.291
Well. still studying.

209
00:13:37.333 --> 00:13:39.041
-On top of that. I'm a nurse.
-Wow.

210
00:13:39.125 --> 00:13:40.083
I graduated.

211
00:13:40.166 --> 00:13:42.750
I kind of feel like we've crossed paths.

212
00:13:43.875 --> 00:13:46.291
Your face looks familiar. you know?

213
00:13:46.375 --> 00:13:47.833
