214
00:13:47.916 --> 00:13:49.958
Where did you work. Elize? I'm curious.

215
00:13:50.041 --> 00:13:51.166
What's this?

216
00:13:51.958 --> 00:13:53.750
Am I being interrogated now?

217
00:13:53.833 --> 00:13:58.416
I just want to learn more
about the girl that caught my best friend.

218
00:13:58.500 --> 00:13:59.541
[chuckles]

219
00:14:01.916 --> 00:14:03.000
[Marcos] Heitor.

220
00:14:06.958 --> 00:14:08.333
-This one here.
-[gasps]

221
00:14:08.416 --> 00:14:11.000
-A special privilege. [chuckles]
-Thank you. man.

222
00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.750
-[Elize grunts]
-[Marcos] Hey. Blondie. How's it going?

223
00:14:18.916 --> 00:14:20.291
[grunts] Almost there.

224
00:14:21.708 --> 00:14:23.958
[knife cutting]

225
00:14:24.708 --> 00:14:26.250
[friend] Marcos. look.

226
00:14:28.291 --> 00:14:30.000
Her first kill.

227
00:14:32.833 --> 00:14:34.833
