229
00:14:46.458 --> 00:14:47.583
[Marcos] Mm-hmm.

230
00:14:50.208 --> 00:14:52.541
-[Marcos laughing]
-[Elize screams] Oh. I'm scared!

231
00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:56.166
-Hang on. I have to turn on the lights.
-[chuckles]

232
00:14:57.541 --> 00:14:58.833
-Ay!
-Oh. where are you going?

233
00:14:58.916 --> 00:14:59.833
I don't know.

234
00:14:59.916 --> 00:15:01.916
Watch your step. That's it.

235
00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:05.250
-[Elize chuckles] Hmm.
-[suspenseful music playing]

236
00:15:05.916 --> 00:15:08.083
-Don't move. okay?
-Okay.

237
00:15:08.791 --> 00:15:10.833
Marcos. where are you?

238
00:15:17.333 --> 00:15:19.500
[snake hissing]

239
00:15:19.583 --> 00:15:21.250
[Elize squeaks]

240
00:15:21.333 --> 00:15:22.750
What's this?

241
00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:27.500
What is this. Marcos?

242
00:15:27.583 --> 00:15:30.583
-[chuckles] Her name is Gigi.
-[gasps]

243
00:15:31.375 --> 00:15:33.208
Oh. she's so gorgeous.

244
00:15:33.291 --> 00:15:34.333
I know. right?

245
00:15:34.416 --> 00:15:37.333
-Oh. my God. she's…
-[laughing]

246
00:15:37.416 --> 00:15:40.666
-Oh hi. Gigi. This is Blondie.
-So sweet!

247
00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:43.500
She's so pretty. She's wonderful.

248
00:15:43.583 --> 00:15:45.791
-Yeah.
-Oh. hi.

249
00:15:45.875 --> 00:15:47.166
She likes you. I think.

250
00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:49.125
-She does?
-Mm-hmm.

251
00:15:49.208 --> 00:15:51.375
-Hi there.
-[chuckles]

252
00:15:54.541 --> 00:15:55.916
What is this place?

253
00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:58.125
Our house.

254
00:15:58.208 --> 00:15:59.458
Do you like it?

255
00:16:00.041 --> 00:16:00.875
[Elize gasps]

256
00:16:01.708 --> 00:16:03.458
-Ours?
-Mm-hmm.

257
00:16:03.541 --> 00:16:05.541
[gentle music playing]

258
00:16:05.625 --> 00:16:06.708
[chuckles]

259
00:16:08.500 --> 00:16:11.333
-It has two stories?
-And a pool too.

260
00:16:12.708 --> 00:16:13.833
A sauna.

261
00:16:16.208 --> 00:16:17.333
You like it?

262
00:16:19.791 --> 00:16:21.750
I signed the divorce papers.

263
00:16:27.083 --> 00:16:28.875
I want to marry you.

264
00:16:28.958 --> 00:16:30.875
You'll quit VipClass.

265
00:16:30.958 --> 00:16:32.625
We can even have a baby.

266
00:16:32.708 --> 00:16:34.541
A new life for us.

267
00:16:34.625 --> 00:16:35.958
Just for us.

268
00:16:38.333 --> 00:16:39.541
Forever?

269
00:16:41.125 --> 00:16:42.541
Yes. forever.

270
00:16:42.625 --> 00:16:44.541
[gentle music continues]

271
00:17:04.208 --> 00:17:05.458
[indistinct chatter]

272
00:17:05.541 --> 00:17:07.041
-Hello!
-[Elize] Look at this.

273
00:17:07.125 --> 00:17:09.625
-Isn't this the one you liked?
-[woman] God. I've never used this.

274
00:17:09.708 --> 00:17:12.208
-[Elize] You always wanted to.
-[woman] I used to dream of it.

275
00:17:12.291 --> 00:17:17.125
Wait. you can open it later.
Let me show you this.

276
00:17:17.208 --> 00:17:19.125
[gasps]

277
00:17:19.208 --> 00:17:20.333
Two hundred guests.

278
00:17:20.416 --> 00:17:23.375
-Elize. this is so gorgeous. Amazing.
-[chuckles]

279
00:17:23.458 --> 00:17:24.833
-Wait 'till you see the ring.
-Show!

280
00:17:24.916 --> 00:17:27.000
-Oh. ooh. Look at that!
-[Elize laughing]

281
00:17:27.083 --> 00:17:29.333
[woman] It's so shiny. so pretty.

282
00:17:29.416 --> 00:17:30.916
Pity he couldn't join us here.

283
00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:34.791
I hoped he'd make it.
even insisted. but he's been so busy.

284
00:17:34.875 --> 00:17:36.916
Talk to me.
His family. what are they like?

285
00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:38.666
Oh. his family is nice.

286
00:17:39.458 --> 00:17:41.416
His mother is kind.

287
00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:43.208
Father barely speaks at all.

288
00:17:43.291 --> 00:17:45.458
I don't know much about his brother.

289
00:17:45.541 --> 00:17:47.500
-His cousin's been a friend.
-[chuckles]

290
00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.333
-And Marcos…
-[rooster crowing]

291
00:17:50.416 --> 00:17:52.416
Oh. he's been so sweet.

292
00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.166
He's fun. you know?

293
00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:56.000
He's like one of us.

294
00:17:56.916 --> 00:17:59.208
You were very lonely. you know?

295
00:17:59.291 --> 00:18:01.708
-Good to have a companion.
-[birds squawking]

296
00:18:01.791 --> 00:18:04.916
And you found someone
that you can start to build a family with.

297
00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:07.916
It's so nice. Hmm!

298
00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:08.875
Very good.

299
00:18:08.958 --> 00:18:11.708
[man] Hey! Give your uncle a hug.

300
00:18:11.791 --> 00:18:13.833
Oh. you look so cute.

301
00:18:13.916 --> 00:18:15.333
-Auntie…
-Easy.

302
00:18:15.416 --> 00:18:17.291
Let's go to the living room. come on.

303
00:18:17.375 --> 00:18:18.791
-That dessert you like.
-[woman] Oh.

304
00:18:18.875 --> 00:18:21.250
-There's extra to take…
-[woman] Thank you so much.

305
00:18:21.333 --> 00:18:23.750
I don't know why. but I'm so hungry.

306
00:18:24.625 --> 00:18:26.125
-Hi. honey.
-Hi. Mom.

307
00:18:27.666 --> 00:18:29.000
Do you want my blessing?

308
00:18:29.083 --> 00:18:31.583
-Bless me?
-May God bless you.

309
00:18:31.666 --> 00:18:33.958
So pretty. You look different.

310
00:18:35.458 --> 00:18:36.833
Hey. Dri!

311
00:18:36.916 --> 00:18:39.500
-Oh. Auntie! How I missed you!
-Sweetie. it's been so long.

312
00:18:39.583 --> 00:18:41.500
I missed you too. Wanna see my new car?

313
00:18:41.583 --> 00:18:44.166
-Our aunt has a big car now.
-So fancy!

314
00:18:44.250 --> 00:18:45.750
[man] You look so pretty.

315
00:18:45.833 --> 00:18:47.541
-Look at you.
-[tense music playing]

316
00:18:47.625 --> 00:18:48.750
Let's look at this glove.

317
00:18:48.833 --> 00:18:51.250
-Will my hand fit? It does.
-Coming. Auntie?

318
00:18:51.333 --> 00:18:52.750
Look at that.

319
00:18:56.375 --> 00:18:58.791
[Elize] Nena.
come see my car. okay? Come on.

320
00:18:58.875 --> 00:19:00.041
Hi. Elize.

321
00:19:00.125 --> 00:19:02.125
[footsteps receding]

322
00:19:04.875 --> 00:19:06.958
[music fades]

323
00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:11.958
[man] Elize.

324
00:19:13.958 --> 00:19:16.333
[knife cutting]

325
00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:24.333
Excuse me.

326
00:19:27.041 --> 00:19:29.541
-[birds chirping]
-[water pouring]

327
00:19:35.875 --> 00:19:37.541
[man exhales]

328
00:19:43.291 --> 00:19:45.500
Is that big car outside yours. Elize?

329
00:19:47.291 --> 00:19:50.875
Figure you must have
really gone and worked…

330
00:19:52.291 --> 00:19:54.083
hard for something like that. huh?

331
00:19:54.166 --> 00:19:56.166
[tense music playing]

332
00:19:57.375 --> 00:19:59.208
[man slurping]

333
00:20:03.375 --> 00:20:04.708
[man exhales]

334
00:20:05.708 --> 00:20:06.791
Well.

335
00:20:07.875 --> 00:20:09.750
Congratulations. honey.

336
00:20:10.333 --> 00:20:13.208
Don't you even think
about coming near me again. got it?

337
00:20:13.291 --> 00:20:14.333
Hey. baby…

338
00:20:14.416 --> 00:20:16.750
If I find out
you did something to any of them.

339
00:20:16.833 --> 00:20:18.500
I'll cut that shrimp dick right off.

340
00:20:18.583 --> 00:20:20.750
-You like it. don't ya?
-Don't laugh!

341
00:20:22.791 --> 00:20:24.166
Put it down.

342
00:20:24.875 --> 00:20:27.666
-Just put it down.
-What's going on? Are you crazy?

343
00:20:27.750 --> 00:20:30.125
She's deranged. totally deranged.

344
00:20:30.208 --> 00:20:31.416
A lunatic.

345
00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:32.666
[music fades]

346
00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.916
Mom… [panting]

347
00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:36.416
I told you already.

348
00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:39.541
We don't ever want to see you here again.

349
00:20:39.625 --> 00:20:41.541
Elize. what do you want?

350
00:20:42.083 --> 00:20:44.166
Do you want to ruin my marriage for good?

351
00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:46.708
[dramatic music playing]

352
00:20:53.333 --> 00:20:55.333
[panting]

353
00:20:56.583 --> 00:20:58.625
[crying]

354
00:21:00.500 --> 00:21:01.458
[car beeps]

355
00:21:01.541 --> 00:21:03.541
-[panting. crying]
-[music stops]

356
00:21:17.083 --> 00:21:19.041
-[screams]
-[camera flash charging]

357
00:21:19.125 --> 00:21:22.041
["Love on the Brain" by Rihanna playing]

358
00:21:34.041 --> 00:21:36.708
<i>♪ And you got me like. oh… ♪</i>

359
00:21:38.291 --> 00:21:40.375
-You're so gorgeous.
-Love you so much.

360
00:21:40.458 --> 00:21:41.291
And I love you.

361
00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:45.625
[Elize] I. Elize…

362
00:21:45.708 --> 00:21:48.666
-[priest] Promise to love you…
-[Elize] …promise to love you…

363
00:21:48.750 --> 00:21:51.708
-[priest] …and to respect you. Marcos…
-[Elize] …and to respect you. Marcos…

364
00:21:51.791 --> 00:21:53.708
[priest] …for the rest of my life.

365
00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:56.000
…for the rest of my life.

366
00:21:56.083 --> 00:21:56.958
[Marcos] I. Marcos…

367
00:21:57.041 --> 00:21:59.583
-[priest] Promise to love you…
-[Marcos] …promise to love you…

368
00:21:59.666 --> 00:22:03.333
-[priest] …and to respect you. Elize…
-[Marcos] …and to respect you. Elize…

369
00:22:03.416 --> 00:22:06.541
-[priest] …for the rest of my life.
-…for the rest of my life.

370
00:22:06.625 --> 00:22:09.375
[song continues]

371
00:22:09.458 --> 00:22:11.166
[camera shutter clicks]

372
00:22:12.708 --> 00:22:14.708
[people clapping. cheering]

373
00:22:15.333 --> 00:22:19.333
<i>♪ Must be love on the brain ♪</i>

374
00:22:20.750 --> 00:22:25.208
<i>-♪ That's got me feeling this way ♪</i>
-<i>♪ Feeling this way ♪</i>

375
00:22:25.291 --> 00:22:29.458
<i>♪ It beats me black and blue</i>
<i>But it fucks me so good ♪</i>

376
00:22:29.541 --> 00:22:32.250
<i>♪ And I can't get enough ♪</i>

377
00:22:32.333 --> 00:22:37.750
<i>♪ Must be love on the brain ♪</i>

378
00:22:37.833 --> 00:22:42.041
<i>-♪ And it keeps cursing my name ♪</i>
-<i>♪ Cursing my name ♪</i>

379
00:22:42.125 --> 00:22:46.250
<i>♪ No matter what I do</i>
<i>I'm no good without you ♪</i>

380
00:22:46.333 --> 00:22:49.291
<i>♪ And I can't get enough ♪</i>

381
00:22:49.375 --> 00:22:53.083
<i>♪ Must be love on the brain ♪</i>

382
00:22:53.166 --> 00:22:54.791
[song ends]

383
00:22:54.875 --> 00:22:55.833
[laughing]

384
00:22:55.916 --> 00:22:58.875
You're Marcos's cousin. right?
And you're from São Paulo?

385
00:22:58.958 --> 00:22:59.875
Correct. São Paulo.

386
00:22:59.958 --> 00:23:02.583
-We're from Chopinzinho.
-I know! [chuckles]

387
00:23:02.666 --> 00:23:05.583
It's so different here.
São Paulo is so lively. isn't it?

388
00:23:05.666 --> 00:23:07.583
You came all by yourself. Marta?

389
00:23:07.666 --> 00:23:11.583
Ah. Mr. Matsunaga. Yeah.
unfortunately. my family couldn't be here.

390
00:23:11.666 --> 00:23:13.000
[Mrs. Matsunaga] Good flight?

391
00:23:13.083 --> 00:23:16.166
Yes. I was a little tense
because I'm not used to flying.

392
00:23:16.250 --> 00:23:18.708
-[chuckles]
-Anyway. congratulations.

393
00:23:18.791 --> 00:23:20.458
Your son looks overjoyed.

394
00:23:20.541 --> 00:23:21.500
Thank you so much.

395
00:23:21.583 --> 00:23:24.083
Thank you so much
for welcoming my niece here

396
00:23:24.166 --> 00:23:26.708
into your family
with such kindness and love.

397
00:23:26.791 --> 00:23:29.666
She's a true gift. you know?
She's my angel.

398
00:23:29.750 --> 00:23:31.000
[Elize chuckles]

399
00:23:31.083 --> 00:23:33.208
Marcos was so quick
to get married to Elize

400
00:23:33.291 --> 00:23:35.708
that I thought
it could mean a grandchild soon.

401
00:23:35.791 --> 00:23:37.791
[laughing]

402
00:23:37.875 --> 00:23:39.375
No. no. Mrs. Matsunaga.

403
00:23:39.458 --> 00:23:40.833
You won't be having children?

404
00:23:41.458 --> 00:23:43.375
No. I will. [chuckles]

405
00:23:43.458 --> 00:23:46.375
I was saying we're not ready to have one.

406
00:23:46.458 --> 00:23:49.500
-Maybe soon.
-[laughing]

407
00:23:49.583 --> 00:23:52.083
But Elize has always wanted
the chance to be a mother.

408
00:23:52.166 --> 00:23:54.000
[Elize] We really want to have a baby.

409
00:23:54.083 --> 00:23:56.291
-[both moan]
-[Marta] Aw! [chuckles]

410
00:23:56.375 --> 00:23:58.625
-I was just telling Lauro…
-Ah. no. Heitor!

411
00:23:58.708 --> 00:24:00.916
-No. wait. Come on now.
-Let me talk to your father.

412
00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:02.916
You are finally
gonna pretend to be serious?

413
00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:06.166
Well. Marcos did skip
over the halftime break.

414
00:24:06.250 --> 00:24:08.375
You jumped straight
into the second half. Marcos!

415
00:24:08.458 --> 00:24:09.458
[woman] Heitor!

416
00:24:09.541 --> 00:24:12.041
Well. Marcos doesn't always follow
counsel from the family.

417
00:24:12.125 --> 00:24:13.625
-That's true.
-Right. Pa?

418
00:24:13.708 --> 00:24:14.916
Yeah.

419
00:24:15.000 --> 00:24:17.125
Second time he's been married.

420
00:24:17.208 --> 00:24:19.166
This time has to work out. right. Eliza?

421
00:24:19.250 --> 00:24:21.500
"Lize". it's Elize. yes?

422
00:24:21.583 --> 00:24:22.958
-Yes.
-Ah. Elize.

423
00:24:23.041 --> 00:24:24.708
It'll work out. It'll work out.

424
00:24:24.791 --> 00:24:27.250
Here's to the newlyweds.
Let's raise a glass for them.

425
00:24:27.333 --> 00:24:28.208
Yes. cheers!

426
00:24:28.291 --> 00:24:30.583
-[Marcos] Oh. no!
-No. you can't say "cheers".

427
00:24:30.666 --> 00:24:33.250
-[all] It's "kanpai".
-Kanpai!

428
00:24:34.458 --> 00:24:38.291
Excuse me. Elize. I have someone
I'd like to introduce to you. Mr. Alberto.

429
00:24:38.375 --> 00:24:40.625
-[ominous sting]
-Marcos is a very lucky guy.

430
00:24:41.875 --> 00:24:45.291
Hey. Kelly! You know.
you and my daughter look very similar.

431
00:24:45.375 --> 00:24:47.833
-And this is Luisa. his daughter.
-All the best.

432
00:24:47.916 --> 00:24:50.541
-Thank you.
-Uncle Takashi is in the other hall.

433
00:24:50.625 --> 00:24:52.291
-Let's go. [laughing]
-Coming.

434
00:24:52.375 --> 00:24:55.000
[tense music playing]

435
00:24:55.083 --> 00:24:57.625
-[panting]
-[people chattering. laughing]

436
00:24:58.666 --> 00:25:01.375
-Your hands are cold. What's wrong?
-Nothing.

437
00:25:10.500 --> 00:25:12.500
[inaudible]

438
00:25:13.791 --> 00:25:15.666
[Marcos]
Come. I want to dance with my wife.

439
00:25:16.250 --> 00:25:17.333
Oh. say that again.

440
00:25:17.416 --> 00:25:20.125
-I want to dance. yeah?
-No. [chuckles]

441
00:25:20.208 --> 00:25:21.583
When you said. "my wife".

442
00:25:21.666 --> 00:25:23.750
You are completely my wife.

443
00:25:23.833 --> 00:25:25.166
-Hmm!
-[chuckles]

444
00:25:25.250 --> 00:25:28.000
-[screams. laughing]
-[laughing]

445
00:25:30.291 --> 00:25:33.625
-[Marcos humming]
-[Elize laughing]

446
00:25:33.708 --> 00:25:37.125
["Your Love Is Everything"
by Geoff Gascoyne playing on the speakers]

447
00:25:38.250 --> 00:25:41.166
♪ <i>You're always on my mind </i>♪

448
00:25:41.250 --> 00:25:44.208
<i>♪ So don't waste precious time </i>♪

449
00:25:44.291 --> 00:25:45.125
[sighs]

450
00:25:45.208 --> 00:25:48.666
♪ <i>And give your love to me</i>
<i>It's easy ♪</i>

451
00:25:50.333 --> 00:25:52.875
♪ <i>Your love is good for me ♪</i>

452
00:25:52.958 --> 00:25:54.250
<i>♪ It's true </i>♪

453
00:25:56.458 --> 00:25:59.208
<i>♪ That I am helpless without you </i>♪

454
00:25:59.291 --> 00:26:01.458
[suspenseful music playing]

455
00:26:07.833 --> 00:26:10.583
My collection is all yours as well.

456
00:26:10.666 --> 00:26:11.833
[Elize] Mmm.

457
00:26:21.041 --> 00:26:23.125
Oh. you're such a badass. yeah?

458
00:26:24.291 --> 00:26:25.583
Undress.

459
00:26:29.166 --> 00:26:31.291
-Okay.
-[clothes unzipping]

460
00:26:31.375 --> 00:26:32.708
I like that.

461
00:26:33.500 --> 00:26:34.875
[chuckles]

462
00:26:52.500 --> 00:26:55.708
[both panting. moaning]

463
00:27:00.333 --> 00:27:02.750
-[music stops]
-[elevator gears clanging]

464
00:27:04.541 --> 00:27:06.791
3 YEARS BEFORE THE CRIME

465
00:27:06.875 --> 00:27:09.416
There was this lady
in the row behind me on the plane. Argh.

466
00:27:09.500 --> 00:27:10.500
2. SANDCASTLE

467
00:27:10.583 --> 00:27:12.875
She went on and on for the entire flight.

468
00:27:12.958 --> 00:27:15.291
Oh. my God. Elize.

469
00:27:15.375 --> 00:27:19.166
This is my house. Auntie.
And our pool. you see. is there. upstairs.

470
00:27:19.250 --> 00:27:20.791
-[gasps]
-And this view.

471
00:27:20.875 --> 00:27:23.041
Wow. to keep it clean
must be a lot of work.

472
00:27:23.125 --> 00:27:24.125
[Elize] Yeah.

473
00:27:24.208 --> 00:27:27.791
I'm so happy you came to visit us.
And Marcos is happy as well.

474
00:27:27.875 --> 00:27:29.958
I'd get lost in this maze of a mansion.

475
00:27:30.041 --> 00:27:32.541
-Ah. you'll get used to it.
-Hello. Ms. Marta.

476
00:27:32.625 --> 00:27:34.708
Oh. Marcos. How are you?

477
00:27:34.791 --> 00:27:36.875
-Doing well?
-Doing well. Very well.

478
00:27:37.375 --> 00:27:40.000
And Elize has been super excited
to have you over.

479
00:27:40.083 --> 00:27:41.791
Beautiful house that you have here.

480
00:27:41.875 --> 00:27:44.208
Please make yourself at home
while you're here.

481
00:27:44.291 --> 00:27:46.125
But. sadly. I can't stay.

482
00:27:46.208 --> 00:27:48.500
-What?
-I'm going to Brasília. Remember?

483
00:27:48.583 --> 00:27:50.666
-You didn't tell me you were traveling.
-I did.

484
00:27:50.750 --> 00:27:53.208
-No. my love. you didn't.
-I did. You're confused.

485
00:27:53.291 --> 00:27:56.416
No. I'm not just confused.
We have the doctor tomorrow.

486
00:27:56.958 --> 00:27:59.250
It's your doctor appointment. not mine.

487
00:28:00.000 --> 00:28:02.583
Not for me.
You are the one having trouble.

488
00:28:02.666 --> 00:28:04.083
[melancholic music playing]

489
00:28:04.166 --> 00:28:06.125
[Marcos] Is this gynecologist any good?

490
00:28:06.625 --> 00:28:07.625
The best in São Paulo.

491
00:28:07.708 --> 00:28:11.000
Yeah. for some. getting pregnant
might take more time. It's natural.

492
00:28:11.083 --> 00:28:13.708
Ah! Auntie Marta can go with you then.

493
00:28:13.791 --> 00:28:15.166
Yes. I'd be happy to join.

494
00:28:15.250 --> 00:28:17.375
[Marcos] Thank you. Make yourself at home.

495
00:28:17.458 --> 00:28:20.416
[suitcase wheels rolling away]

496
00:28:20.500 --> 00:28:21.875
