[siren wailing in the distance]

748
00:44:28.625 --> 00:44:31.458
MARCOS 4 HOURS AGO
MY FLIGHT WAS CANCELED. DON'T WAIT UP

749
00:44:53.375 --> 00:44:54.500
My love?

750
00:45:06.000 --> 00:45:08.000
[snoring]

751
00:45:13.916 --> 00:45:15.041
Honey?

752
00:45:15.125 --> 00:45:16.458
-Huh?
-Wanna come to bed?

753
00:45:16.541 --> 00:45:19.500
I'll just sleep right here. [groans]

754
00:45:20.750 --> 00:45:23.166
-Come to bed now.
-I love you.

755
00:45:24.333 --> 00:45:26.333
[snoring softly]

756
00:45:40.416 --> 00:45:42.416
[suspenseful music playing]

757
00:45:48.583 --> 00:45:50.958
[snores. clears throat]

758
00:46:37.583 --> 00:46:38.541
[beep]

759
00:46:47.625 --> 00:46:49.291
I CAN'T WAIT FOR YOU TO…

760
00:46:50.416 --> 00:46:53.166
{\an8}[Elize] <i>"I can't wait</i>
<i>for you to quit VipClass."</i>

761
00:46:53.250 --> 00:46:54.875
{\an8}MARCOS: OH. YOU'RE SO HOT

762
00:46:59.958 --> 00:47:00.958
[gasps]

763
00:47:06.708 --> 00:47:09.125
[shower running]

764
00:47:10.500 --> 00:47:12.916
-[shower stops]
-[music fades]

765
00:47:28.375 --> 00:47:29.791
Are you asleep?

766
00:47:34.708 --> 00:47:36.500
Hey. come here.

767
00:47:37.541 --> 00:47:40.291
-[tense music playing]
-[Marcos breathing heavily]

768
00:47:40.375 --> 00:47:41.916
Come on. come here.

769
00:47:44.041 --> 00:47:47.166
[scoffs] Are you really
going to leave me hanging?

770
00:47:47.875 --> 00:47:50.583
-I'm just tired.
-[scoffs]

771
00:47:50.666 --> 00:47:54.375
You used to spend all night taking care
of multiple clients in that club of yours.

772
00:47:54.458 --> 00:47:55.708
And you didn't get tired.

773
00:47:55.791 --> 00:47:57.375
What did you just say?

774
00:47:58.250 --> 00:47:59.666
What? [laughs]

775
00:48:01.000 --> 00:48:05.458
You have a maid. a nanny.
a credit card. a house. a car.

776
00:48:05.541 --> 00:48:07.083
What else do you want?

777
00:48:07.166 --> 00:48:10.166
You can't please your husband
who pays for all this?

778
00:48:10.250 --> 00:48:11.708
I don't want to fight you.

779
00:48:13.291 --> 00:48:14.625
Want me to pay you?

780
00:48:18.875 --> 00:48:20.125
[bills rustling]

781
00:48:20.208 --> 00:48:25.500
A hundred. two hundred.
three hundred. six hundred.

782
00:48:26.166 --> 00:48:28.166
Take it all. Is that enough?

783
00:48:28.875 --> 00:48:30.958
I'm your fucking wife. not your hooker.

784
00:48:31.041 --> 00:48:32.750
I am the mother of your daughter.

785
00:48:34.500 --> 00:48:36.000
That's the problem.

786
00:48:37.750 --> 00:48:39.000
You will abandon me.

787
00:48:39.083 --> 00:48:41.250
-Aw. not this again.
-You made a promise.

788
00:48:41.333 --> 00:48:44.583
You said what happened to your ex-wife
would never happen to me.

789
00:48:44.666 --> 00:48:47.041
-First chance you get. you go back…
-Stop! Shut it!

790
00:48:47.583 --> 00:48:48.875
Look at yourself.

791
00:48:49.750 --> 00:48:51.375
You are hysterical.

792
00:48:52.833 --> 00:48:56.875
With how worried I am right now.
I wouldn't leave my daughter in your care.

793
00:48:57.958 --> 00:48:59.333
See a doctor.

794
00:48:59.416 --> 00:49:01.416
[melancholic music playing]

795
00:49:03.500 --> 00:49:04.916
Crazy bitch.

796
00:49:07.500 --> 00:49:08.416
[gasps]

797
00:49:09.041 --> 00:49:11.041
[door opens. slams]

798
00:49:21.750 --> 00:49:24.083
MENTAL HEALTH
PSYCHIATRIC CLINIC

799
00:49:30.458 --> 00:49:31.916
[Elize] Rehabilitation.

800
00:49:32.416 --> 00:49:35.416
Private room. 680 reais.

801
00:49:36.125 --> 00:49:39.166
Half day. 350 per day.

802
00:49:39.250 --> 00:49:43.416
[voice starts to fade]
Medication. 120 to 450.

803
00:49:43.500 --> 00:49:45.500
[suspenseful music playing]

804
00:50:05.916 --> 00:50:09.500
<i>You've reached Danielle's voicemail.</i>
<i>I can't answer the phone right now.</i>

805
00:50:09.583 --> 00:50:11.458
<i>Leave your message after the beep.</i>

806
00:50:11.541 --> 00:50:13.083
[phone call ends]

807
00:50:19.833 --> 00:50:23.833
[music intensifies]

808
00:50:23.916 --> 00:50:25.916
[pensive music playing]

809
00:50:37.708 --> 00:50:39.708
[snake hissing]

810
00:50:57.875 --> 00:51:01.291
-[upbeat music playing]
-[people chattering. laughing]

811
00:51:10.291 --> 00:51:11.500
[cell phone chimes]

812
00:51:11.583 --> 00:51:15.375
{\an8}DANIELLE: WHERE R U BABY?
R U COMING?

813
00:51:24.833 --> 00:51:26.166
[cell phone ringing]

814
00:51:29.458 --> 00:51:30.416
Hello?

815
00:51:31.708 --> 00:51:32.833
Ah. Hello?

816
00:51:34.416 --> 00:51:35.500
Hello?

817
00:51:37.583 --> 00:51:38.583
Sorry.

818
00:51:41.125 --> 00:51:42.625
-Are you available?
-No. no.

819
00:51:46.875 --> 00:51:48.625
Why aren't you answering?

820
00:51:48.708 --> 00:51:50.375
[Elize] Honey. can I get a martini?

821
00:51:50.458 --> 00:51:51.416
Same for me.

822
00:51:51.958 --> 00:51:53.250
Double. please.

823
00:51:54.541 --> 00:51:56.791
-Celebrating?
-I dunno. Just trying to cheer up.

824
00:51:56.875 --> 00:51:58.916
Had a no-show client
and he won't answer calls.

825
00:51:59.750 --> 00:52:01.250
Well. look around the place.

826
00:52:02.500 --> 00:52:04.500
Plenty of gracious clients. honey.

827
00:52:06.375 --> 00:52:07.541
Are you new to this?

828
00:52:08.666 --> 00:52:10.000
More or less. yeah.

829
00:52:10.791 --> 00:52:12.333
I used to come here.

830
00:52:13.041 --> 00:52:16.041
Then I stopped after a while.
Went exclusive.

831
00:52:16.125 --> 00:52:17.250
My fantasy.

832
00:52:17.333 --> 00:52:18.791
-Oh. yeah?
-Uh-huh.

833
00:52:18.875 --> 00:52:20.708
Ah. but it's not difficult. right?

834
00:52:20.791 --> 00:52:23.916
Eh. just avoid the married ones.
Those men are tricky.

835
00:52:24.958 --> 00:52:26.375
It's the married ones I love.

836
00:52:26.958 --> 00:52:28.666
How powerful.

837
00:52:28.750 --> 00:52:31.791
No. I think
it's just so much simpler. you know?

838
00:52:31.875 --> 00:52:33.958
They tend to be
more preoccupied with their wives.

839
00:52:34.041 --> 00:52:36.458
so they're much less
of a pain in the ass for us.

840
00:52:37.500 --> 00:52:39.416
-I have one like that.
-Huh?

841
00:52:40.375 --> 00:52:41.916
A prince. I bet?

842
00:52:42.000 --> 00:52:44.541
[chuckling] More or less. yeah.

843
00:52:44.625 --> 00:52:47.083
He's saying he'll leave his wife
to be with me now.

844
00:52:47.166 --> 00:52:48.125
[ominous sting]

845
00:52:48.208 --> 00:52:49.916
The guy is obsessed with me.

846
00:52:50.000 --> 00:52:52.250
He gives me gifts. takes me on trips.

847
00:52:52.333 --> 00:52:56.000
to dinner at Japanese restaurants.
taught me about wine.

848
00:52:56.083 --> 00:52:57.708
In his case. I kinda get it.

849
00:52:57.791 --> 00:52:59.500
His wife is kind of…

850
00:53:00.541 --> 00:53:01.833
out of her mind.

851
00:53:02.625 --> 00:53:04.625
-[glasses clink]
-[Danielle] Cheers!

852
00:53:05.166 --> 00:53:08.500
It's on the level
of psychiatric clinics. medication…

853
00:53:09.208 --> 00:53:11.250
He's having her admitted next week.

854
00:53:11.333 --> 00:53:13.333
[ominous music playing]

855
00:53:13.416 --> 00:53:16.458
[camera shutter clicking]

856
00:53:33.083 --> 00:53:34.791
[music fades]

857
00:53:53.125 --> 00:53:54.000
Well?

858
00:53:54.541 --> 00:53:56.291
So. he's still in there with her.

859
00:53:57.208 --> 00:53:59.666
Look. This is from when they arrived.

860
00:53:59.750 --> 00:54:01.125
Each in their own car.

861
00:54:01.208 --> 00:54:02.625
And look closely. you'll see.

862
00:54:02.708 --> 00:54:05.041
Her car is just like yours.
same color even.

863
00:54:06.375 --> 00:54:08.958
-They've been there for about two hours.
-I knew it.

864
00:54:09.541 --> 00:54:12.041
I took pictures too. The whole package.

865
00:54:12.125 --> 00:54:13.791
Your lawyer will love it. huh?

866
00:54:14.875 --> 00:54:16.833
-Mrs. Elize. this is…
-Go away.

867
00:54:17.458 --> 00:54:18.958
Send me everything. Go!

868
00:54:19.041 --> 00:54:20.416
Of course.

869
00:54:23.041 --> 00:54:26.708
-[tense music playing]
-[door opens. closes]

870
00:55:06.541 --> 00:55:08.541
[music fades]

871
00:55:14.458 --> 00:55:17.375
18 HOURS AFTER THE CRIME

872
00:55:17.458 --> 00:55:19.458
[suspenseful music playing]

873
00:55:19.541 --> 00:55:22.666
3. EYE OF THE STORM

874
00:55:29.625 --> 00:55:31.041
[car beeps]

875
00:55:41.416 --> 00:55:44.916
[metal clanging in the background]

876
00:55:55.958 --> 00:55:59.166
[panting. grunting]

877
00:56:19.791 --> 00:56:22.041
[breathing heavily]

878
00:56:32.375 --> 00:56:34.041
[cell phone dialing]

879
00:56:34.125 --> 00:56:35.916
Hi Marcinha. How are you?

880
00:56:36.000 --> 00:56:39.083
Listen. I went out for a bit.
How's my little girl?

881
00:56:39.166 --> 00:56:41.083
[Marcinha] <i>She's a little warm.</i>

882
00:56:41.166 --> 00:56:44.250
<i>She has a fever of a 100ºF.</i>
<i>Can I give her the usual medicine?</i>

883
00:56:44.333 --> 00:56:45.791
-Sure.
-<i>Twenty drops. right?</i>

884
00:56:45.875 --> 00:56:48.125
Sure. And is Marcos at home?

885
00:56:48.208 --> 00:56:51.125
-<i>No. ma'am.</i>
-Okay. I'll call him. Bye.

886
00:56:54.416 --> 00:56:55.791
[sniffs]

887
00:56:57.333 --> 00:56:58.875
[crying]

888
00:57:06.916 --> 00:57:08.916
-[music fades]
-[birds chirping]

889
00:57:11.750 --> 00:57:14.666
[breathing heavily]

890
00:57:16.000 --> 00:57:18.000
[suspenseful music playing]

891
00:57:49.041 --> 00:57:51.041
[crickets chirping]

892
00:57:53.500 --> 00:57:55.333
[cell phone ringing]

893
00:57:56.375 --> 00:57:57.875
Hi. Marcinha. How are things?

894
00:57:57.958 --> 00:58:01.166
<i>-</i>[Marcinha] <i>Almost a hundred four degrees.</i>
-A hundred and four?

895
00:58:01.250 --> 00:58:04.125
-Did you give her a bath?
-<i>I did. I don't know what else to do.</i>

896
00:58:04.208 --> 00:58:06.666
Okay. I'm heading back now. Bye.

897
00:58:07.458 --> 00:58:09.458
[tense music playing]

898
00:58:22.750 --> 00:58:24.208
[siren wailing]

899
00:58:24.291 --> 00:58:25.250
[Elize] Not now.

900
00:58:28.500 --> 00:58:30.166
Please pull over. ma'am.

901
00:58:39.416 --> 00:58:40.625
Good evening. ma'am.

902
00:58:40.708 --> 00:58:43.000
-Good evening.
-This is just a routine check.

903
00:58:43.083 --> 00:58:45.625
-[siren wailing]
-[chatter over the police radio]

904
00:58:49.750 --> 00:58:52.333
[tense music continues]

905
00:58:58.416 --> 00:59:00.375
What's the matter? Are you nervous. ma'am?

906
00:59:00.458 --> 00:59:01.500
No.

907
00:59:02.000 --> 00:59:04.833
It's just that I really need
to get home soon.

908
00:59:04.916 --> 00:59:07.083
See. my baby has a high fever.

909
00:59:07.166 --> 00:59:09.875
Could you possibly let me go
just this once?

910
00:59:12.458 --> 00:59:13.958
License and registration.

911
00:59:27.083 --> 00:59:28.041
I'll be right back.

912
00:59:57.000 --> 00:59:58.916
The car's registration is expired.

913
00:59:59.500 --> 01:00:01.625
Ask your husband to take care of that.

914
01:00:03.125 --> 01:00:04.208
Okay. You're free to go.

915
01:00:04.291 --> 01:00:07.333
-Hey. stop. You two. Stop!
-Good night. officer. Thanks.

916
01:00:07.416 --> 01:00:10.250
You there!
Pull over. pull over. pull over.

917
01:00:15.666 --> 01:00:17.666
[thunder cracking]

918
01:00:17.750 --> 01:00:19.791
[tense music continues]

919
01:00:42.125 --> 01:00:44.458
[panting]

920
01:00:46.500 --> 01:00:47.875
[straining]

921
01:00:48.625 --> 01:00:50.625
[cell phone ringing]

922
01:01:18.208 --> 01:01:21.458
HAS THE FEVER GONE DOWN?

923
01:01:38.666 --> 01:01:40.666
[panting. straining]

924
01:01:48.625 --> 01:01:50.625
[animal growling]

925
01:01:56.500 --> 01:01:57.833
[dog barking]

926
01:01:57.916 --> 01:01:59.041
[grunts]

927
01:02:02.125 --> 01:02:03.583
[whispering] That scared me.

928
01:02:21.666 --> 01:02:23.958
-[ominous sting]
-[music fades]

929
01:02:29.500 --> 01:02:31.833
[man] It's been two days
since I last heard from him.

930
01:02:31.916 --> 01:02:34.750
Mm-hmm. Let me know
if you hear anything. Thanks.

931
01:02:34.833 --> 01:02:36.833
[water pouring]

932
01:02:40.416 --> 01:02:43.416
I know you're feeling nervous.
dear. but try to remember.

933
01:02:43.500 --> 01:02:45.291
For his sake. try.

934
01:02:45.375 --> 01:02:47.375
[breathes deeply]

935
01:02:51.375 --> 01:02:53.291
I already told you all I remember.

936
01:02:53.375 --> 01:02:55.625
Try to stay calm and really think back.

937
01:02:55.708 --> 01:02:58.375
See. even the smallest detail
could be of help.

938
01:03:02.125 --> 01:03:04.583
I woke up when I heard him
moving all his things around.

939
01:03:04.666 --> 01:03:05.791
[Heitor] What things?

940
01:03:07.000 --> 01:03:08.625
Well. like a bag. a carry-on.

941
01:03:08.708 --> 01:03:10.250
[suspenseful music playing]

942
01:03:16.041 --> 01:03:17.791
Some shirts and pants.

943
01:03:20.833 --> 01:03:24.541
His cash. laptop. and his cell phone.

944
01:03:27.666 --> 01:03:28.750
He had to be kidnapped.

945
01:03:28.833 --> 01:03:30.416
-Don't even say that.
-[gasps]

946
01:03:30.500 --> 01:03:33.458
[man] Marcos disappears
the week of the company selling?

947
01:03:33.541 --> 01:03:36.333
-It isn't a coincidence.
-Why hasn't anyone contacted us?

948
01:03:39.791 --> 01:03:43.416
[Mrs. Matsunaga] Are you sure he didn't
say anything else before he left?

949
01:03:44.666 --> 01:03:47.000
He said he wouldn't be back until later.

950
01:03:48.625 --> 01:03:49.958
That he might not be back.

951
01:03:52.666 --> 01:03:55.125
He leaned over on the bed… [groans]

952
01:03:56.375 --> 01:03:57.708
…and kissed my head.

953
01:03:59.958 --> 01:04:03.291
He said. "A man has to do
what a man has to do."

954
01:04:05.041 --> 01:04:08.083
I just want him to be okay. that's all.

955
01:04:09.375 --> 01:04:10.458
It's okay.

956
01:04:10.541 --> 01:04:11.625
[doorbell rings]

957
01:04:11.708 --> 01:04:13.833
-That should be the police.
-[Elize gasps]

958
01:04:14.458 --> 01:04:15.916
[door opens]

959
01:04:16.625 --> 01:04:18.291
[Mrs. Matsunaga] He'll turn up.

960
01:04:19.208 --> 01:04:20.791
Marcos will be all right.

961
01:04:21.500 --> 01:04:22.583
Yeah.

962
01:04:22.666 --> 01:04:25.875
-There must be an explanation.
-[officer] Hello.

963
01:04:26.833 --> 01:04:29.416
If you need something.
you know I'm around.

964
01:04:30.500 --> 01:04:31.625
I know that.

965
01:04:32.208 --> 01:04:33.541
Don't forget.

966
01:04:33.625 --> 01:04:34.708
Thank you.

967
01:04:34.791 --> 01:04:36.083
[officer] Stay calm.

968
01:04:37.083 --> 01:04:38.375
There's still time.

969
01:04:40.500 --> 01:04:44.041
He hasn't seemed to reach out yet.
but we're tracking everything. and we…

970
01:04:44.125 --> 01:04:45.208
This is Clarice.

971
01:04:45.291 --> 01:04:46.375
-How are you?
-Hello.

972
01:04:46.458 --> 01:04:48.291
Elize. She's Marcos' wife.

973
01:04:48.375 --> 01:04:50.083
-Good afternoon.
-Good afternoon.

974
01:04:50.166 --> 01:04:51.666
[sniffs] Heard anything yet?

975
01:04:51.750 --> 01:04:55.375
Chief Aquino was explaining that
they're distributing a photo of Marcos

976
01:04:55.458 --> 01:04:58.166
and contacting other police stations.
as well as hospitals.

977
01:04:58.250 --> 01:05:01.958
[woman] And the anti-kidnapping unit
will track any call asking for ransom.

978
01:05:05.083 --> 01:05:06.500
-[beep]
-[ominous music playing]

979
01:05:06.583 --> 01:05:08.166
[reporter on TV] <i>A dark enigma.</i>

980
01:05:08.250 --> 01:05:11.791
<i>Fragments of a body</i>
<i>were left on the side of dirt roads</i>

981
01:05:11.875 --> 01:05:13.875
<i>near the city of São Paulo.</i>

982
01:05:13.958 --> 01:05:16.458
<i>more precisely</i>
<i>in the district of Caucaia do Alto.</i>

983
01:05:16.541 --> 01:05:18.458
{\an8}<i>a rural area of Cotia.</i>

984
01:05:18.541 --> 01:05:21.291
{\an8}<i>In a case that borders on the macabre.</i>

985
01:05:21.375 --> 01:05:23.458
{\an8}<i>near the side of a dirt road.</i>

986
01:05:23.541 --> 01:05:27.625
<i>a single leg was found</i>
<i>inside a blue trash bag.</i>

987
01:05:28.333 --> 01:05:31.458
<i>Civil Guard agents found</i>
<i>the other missing limb.</i>

988
01:05:32.000 --> 01:05:36.166
<i>The search for the mysterious</i>
<i>missing body parts continues.</i>

989
01:05:36.791 --> 01:05:38.583
<i>Hands. arms. and the head.</i>

990
01:05:39.375 --> 01:05:41.958
<i>Crucial pieces to solve this mystery…</i>

991
01:05:42.750 --> 01:05:44.416
[music fades]

992
01:05:45.250 --> 01:05:46.166
[baby babbling]

993
01:05:46.250 --> 01:05:48.833
[man] The police will let us know
if there are any developments.

994
01:05:48.916 --> 01:05:52.708
-We can't wait. It's been nine days.
-[Heitor] It's very strange. Marcos…

995
01:05:53.291 --> 01:05:55.875
He sent an email. made a deposit.
