01:18:54.041 --> 01:18:56.291
-You've been a whore since you were a kid.
-[gun fires]

1237
01:18:56.375 --> 01:18:58.833
-[shell casing hits the floor]
-[Marcos hits the floor]

1238
01:18:58.916 --> 01:19:00.708
-[gasps]
-[music stops]

1239
01:19:06.125 --> 01:19:08.125
-[breathing shakily]
-[gun clicks]

1240
01:19:25.041 --> 01:19:28.791

1241
1240
01:19:28.875 --> 01:19:30.458
[phone dialing]

1242
01:19:30.541 --> 01:19:32.791
[man] <i>Good evening. This is the police.</i>

1243
01:19:32.875 --> 01:19:35.291
<i>-Hello? Is anybody…</i>
-[call disconnects]

1244
01:19:42.500 --> 01:19:43.583
[gasps]

1245
01:20:12.541 --> 01:20:14.541
[breathing deeply]

1246
01:20:18.625 --> 01:20:21.458
[somber music playing]

1247
01:20:21.541 --> 01:20:23.041
[Elize laughing on the TV]

1248
01:20:23.125 --> 01:20:25.125
[Marcos on the TV]
<i>The natural light makes you glow.</i>

1249
01:20:25.208 --> 01:20:26.916
<i>And the view behind you…</i>

1250
01:20:27.000 --> 01:20:30.250
<i>-Let's record this. Look. honey.</i>
-[Elize laughing] No. wait.

1251
01:20:30.916 --> 01:20:33.000
[Marcos] <i>Beautiful. </i>[chuckles]

1252
01:20:35.958 --> 01:20:38.791
<i>-My gorgeous. </i>[chuckles]
-[chuckles]

1253
01:20:38.875 --> 01:20:40.708
<i>-Did you really like it?</i>
<i>-I love it.</i>

1254
01:20:40.791 --> 01:20:44.958
[Marcos] <i>Tell me the truth. You wouldn't</i>
<i>just tell me that to make me happy. right?</i>

1255
01:20:45.041 --> 01:20:47.791
-[Elize laughing]
-[Marcos] <i>You're not lying. right?</i>

1256
01:20:48.583 --> 01:20:50.250
<i>You wouldn't do that to me.</i>

1257
01:21:23.541 --> 01:21:25.541
[somber music continues]

1258
01:21:46.375 --> 01:21:49.333
[knife cutting]

1259
01:21:58.083 --> 01:22:00.500
[breathes deeply]

1260
01:22:04.833 --> 01:22:06.041
[retches]

1261
01:22:11.666 --> 01:22:13.666
-[straining]
-[knife cutting]

1262
01:22:16.291 --> 01:22:17.833
[knife hits the floor]

1263
01:22:22.833 --> 01:22:24.833
[flesh and bones tearing apart]

1264
01:22:48.458 --> 01:22:51.916
[knife cutting flesh]

1265
01:22:54.000 --> 01:22:55.666
[knife cutting rapidly]

1266
01:22:55.750 --> 01:22:57.458
[grunts]

1267
01:23:02.458 --> 01:23:06.875
[bones breaking]

1268
01:23:13.208 --> 01:23:15.208
[music continues]

1269
01:23:24.708 --> 01:23:27.416
[knife cutting]

1270
01:23:27.500 --> 01:23:29.500
[bones breaking]

1271
01:23:31.916 --> 01:23:33.666
[music intensifies and fades]

1272
01:23:34.208 --> 01:23:36.000
[grunts. panting]

1273
01:23:36.083 --> 01:23:38.083
[baby cries in the background]

1274
01:23:39.375 --> 01:23:41.375
[baby crying]

1275
01:23:50.333 --> 01:23:51.208
Mrs. Elize?

1276
01:23:53.083 --> 01:23:55.166
I told you to keep her upstairs. please!

1277
01:23:57.875 --> 01:23:59.583
She needs to breastfeed.

1278
01:24:03.916 --> 01:24:06.083
Leave her in the crib.
I'll be right there.

1279
01:24:12.125 --> 01:24:14.708
Go to the market
and buy what we need for dinner.

1280
01:24:14.791 --> 01:24:15.791
Of course.

1281
01:24:16.500 --> 01:24:17.375
[shushing]

1282
01:24:29.041 --> 01:24:31.875
-[baby crying]
-[music fades]

1283
01:24:44.000 --> 01:24:48.208
[Elize shushing] Mmm.

1284
01:24:53.125 --> 01:24:55.125
[shushing]

1285
01:24:56.208 --> 01:24:58.208
-[baby babbling]
-[kisses]

1286
01:25:03.666 --> 01:25:05.750
[shushing]

1287
01:25:08.958 --> 01:25:10.333
[shushing]

1288
01:25:13.208 --> 01:25:16.750
["O Mundo é um Moinho"
by Badi Assad playing]

1289
01:25:43.833 --> 01:25:45.833
[elevator gears clanging]

1290
01:26:10.083 --> 01:26:12.083
[song continues]

1291
01:26:16.291 --> 01:26:18.416
[camera shutter clicking]

1292
01:26:31.875 --> 01:26:34.458
-[man 1 speaking Portuguese] <i>Assassina!</i>
-[clamoring]

1293
01:26:40.250 --> 01:26:42.083
[man 2 speaking Portuguese] <i>Piranha!</i>

1294
01:26:59.541 --> 01:27:02.208
[sirens wailing]

1295
01:27:11.291 --> 01:27:14.416
[Elize in English] <i>I don't know</i>
<i>when you will read this. my dear.</i>

1296
01:27:14.916 --> 01:27:17.833
<i>I know there are things</i>
<i>you will never understand.</i>

1297
01:27:24.958 --> 01:27:26.958
<i>But there are other things…</i>

1298
01:27:27.708 --> 01:27:29.916
<i>Thing that I will tell you one day.</i>

1299
01:27:30.000 --> 01:27:32.000
[song continues]

1300
01:27:37.291 --> 01:27:38.583
[Elize] <i>But only you.</i>

1301
01:27:39.208 --> 01:27:43.000
IN 2016. ELIZE MATSUNAGA
WAS FOUND GUILTY OF MURDERING

1302
01:27:43.083 --> 01:27:46.125
AND CONCEALING THE BODY
OF MARCOS KITANO MATSUNAGA.

1303
01:27:46.833 --> 01:27:49.458
THE JURY FOUND THAT MARCOS
COULD NOT DEFEND HIMSELF.

1304
01:27:49.541 --> 01:27:50.958
THE JURY REJECTED THE CLAIM

1305
01:27:51.041 --> 01:27:53.708
THAT THE CRIME WAS MOTIVATED
BY REVENGE OR MONEY.

1306
01:27:53.791 --> 01:27:57.500
IN 2019. THE COURT SENTENCED HER
TO 16 YEARS AND 3 MONTHS IN JAIL.

1307
01:27:57.583 --> 01:27:58.791
GIVEN HER CONFESSION.

1308
01:27:58.875 --> 01:28:02.541
HAVING SERVED 10 YEARS.
ELIZE HAS BEEN ON PAROLE SINCE 2022.

1309
01:28:02.625 --> 01:28:06.166
THE MATSUNAGAS WANT TO REMOVE
ELIZE'S LAST NAME FROM THE CHILD.

1310
01:28:06.250 --> 01:28:08.666
AND CUT ALL TIES WITH THE MOTHER.

1311
01:28:09.166 --> 01:28:13.833
ELIZE NEVER SAW HER DAUGHTER AGAIN.

1312
01:28:13.916 --> 01:28:17.208
NOT EVEN IN PHOTOGRAPHS.

1313
01:28:18.375 --> 01:28:20.750
[melancholic music playing]

1314
01:29:46.458 --> 01:29:48.458
[music ends]

1315
01:29:50.541 --> 01:29:52.541
[suspenseful music playing]

1316
01:31:15.541 --> 01:31:17.500
[music fades]

